<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.The above unaudited results as reviewed by the Audit Committee have been approved by the Board of Directors at its meeting held on 10th August, 2019.The Statutory Auditors  of the Company have carried out the  Limited Review  of the above results.  n2. The Company has only one reportable business segment i.e Tyres.  n4. The  Board of Directors have declared a  interim dividend of Rs.2 (100 %)  per equity share of Rs.2/-each. The cash outgo on account of interim dividend and dividend tax will be Rs.4661 lakhs.  n5. The figures of quarter ended 31.03.2019  are the balancing figures between the audited figures of the full financial year and published year to date figures upto  the third quarter  of the  financial year.  n6. The Company has adopted lnd AS-116 'Leases' effective 1st April, 2019 as notified by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs (MCA) and applied the Standard to its leases.This has resulted in recognising a Right-of-Use Asset and a corresponding Lease Liability. The effect of this adoption on the profit for the current quarter is not material.  n7.  The first phase of Carbon  Black project of 60,000 TPA of the Company  is completed  during the quarter and the commerical production has started in the month of July, 2019.  n8. Previous period's/year's  figures have been regrouped/reclassified wherever necessary.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
